					<h2><a href="index.html%3Fp=456" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to Vera Corda">Vera Corda</a></h2>
					<!-- p class="post-info">Feb 8th, 2009 by <a href="http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?author=3" title="Posts by khushi" rel="author">khushi</a> </p -->
